              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I ndelo no, Rwoth waco, miseni bino loyo kere kodi jotel; jocway ri Were i wi migam jolabwok to jotuci wac Were jodhier. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
